Package: russian-keyboard-tool
Version: 1.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Depends: ibus (>= 1.5), libc6 (>= 2.34), libgl1, libx11-6, libxkbcommon0
Maintainer: Xexan Terxcin <xexanterxcin@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/XexanTerxcin/Russian-Keyboard-Tool
Description: system-wide Russian phonetic transliteration keyboard
 Russian Keyboard Tool is an IBus input method that lets you type Russian
 Cyrillic with an ordinary English QWERTY keyboard using phonetic
 transliteration (privet -> привет, khorosho -> хорошо).
 .
 It ships a lightweight top-bar controller, a virtual keyboard view, a
 settings window and a system tray icon. Press Meta+R anywhere to toggle
 between English and Russian.
